{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <strong><em><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2396/content00795?type=0\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">#链产品&nbsp;</span></a></em></strong> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">鉴于云计算、人工智能、机器人等数字智能技术在全球的蓬勃发展，全球各行业的企业在制造领域不断探索，产品、工厂、机器和系统实现链接，在不断改变制造业与服务业的生产和经营模式。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在供应链行业，数字智能技术也在从供给侧和需求侧推动着供应链产生深刻变革，为满足客户逐步升级的个性化需求，企业需要时刻秉承以用户为中心的理念，从提供单一产品向提供集成式、具有开放扩展功能的数字服务产品包转变。那么如何站在用户的角度来帮助操作者更高效地适应行业数字化转型呢?</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #000000;\"><strong>▼</strong></span><em><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #3598db;\"><strong> 一图看懂智能仓储系统 </strong></span></em><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #3598db;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑; color: #000000;\">▼</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/194810/15/26937/1344132/62d77854Ec00c778b/05245f9d93c6765b.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/117355/10/29986/43354/6322ed6bEce7a8190/526ab335bedd80ff.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content00716", "contentTitle": "如何在用户体验设计思维之上构建智能仓储执行系统", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1658285650000, "id": 2256, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/137922/17/27721/48654/62d778d5Ece877665/ad17a1d3cce9e8f3.jpg", "updateTime": 1677147469000}}